the-firm-as-one-program-lines-22 : List (List Word)
the-firm-as-one-program-lines-22 = cons (quoted (cons "- **Q1** " (cons "The market" (cons ": which market? There is one market in the universe of information." nil)))) (cons "  CitSec operates in damn near every market; certain mathematics generalize, data from one market informs the other. Separation would require proof, and physically there is none: it would take distinct physical universes with zero mutual information." (cons "  - **Q1.1** The price of one stock is not a wise place to start. Start from the whole system: every book on every market globally, with all global data (satellite images of parking lots and much more)." (cons (quoted (cons "  - **Q1.2** Begin with a universal space of activity and information; " (cons "the market" (cons " is the space of exchange of assets grounded in this physical universe." nil)))) nil)))
